		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>9-foot-tall construct made of black, glassy volcanic rock.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +5 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Throes</strong>. When reduced to 0 HP, explodes in shard blast, near-sized cube centered on golem. DEX 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Golem</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Jagged Body</strong>. Creatures touching golem take 1d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
